" (You have {0}.)": " (Tu as {0}.)",
"Favours you’ve agreed to are listed in your journal, under Memories. Nothing is timed: take as long as you like.": "Les services que tu as acceptés sont listés dans ton carnet, sous Souvenirs. Rien n’est chronométré : prends tout le temps que tu veux.",
