"the Marine Trust’s seabird warden on Gannet Isle": "la gardienne des oiseaux marins du Marine Trust sur Gannet Isle",
"on Shell Strand": "sur Shell Strand",
"off the end of the quay": "au bout du quai",
"by the slipway": "près de la cale",
"in the lee of the quay": "à l’abri du quai",
"off Wend Quay": "devant Wend Quay",
